WEBVTT

NOTE Captions are burned into plugin-metadata-1x1.mp4 (LinkedIn autoplays muted). This sidecar carries the same text for players and for hosts that accept a caption track. Silent video: there is no narration, and the terminal text is in the transcript.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.567
Fields a Read never shows
owner and eval-suite live in a sidecar. Reading the page alone never shows them.

2
00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:14.367
manni meta get --all-fields
The new flag prints every stored field, page and sidecar alike.

3
00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:20.567
What the Read hook adds
When the agent reads the page, the plugin's hook hands it the metadata, sidecar included.

4
00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:32.000
Once, then on change
A second Read adds nothing. Change the sidecar and the next Read says so.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.800
The graph, over MCP
The plugin's MCP server publishes the graph on first use, then answers from it.

